---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Post 12 (Backtest) figure: Replay. Inline SVG, site tokens only, no ids. Numbers come from the Python runs recorded in the post brief.
---
<figure class="atp12-replay">
  <div class="atp12-replay-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 276" role="img" aria-label="A five-step loop: prices up to the close of day t, a signal computed from them, a position held through day t+1, the return of day t+1 minus costs, and metrics over all days. The first two steps are marked as knowable at the close of day t.">
<text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>A backtest is a replay with one rule: no peeking</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Backtest là một lần phát lại với một luật: không được nhìn trước</tspan></text>
<rect x="20" y="52" width="150" height="100" rx="6" class="okb" />
<DiagramIcon name="db" x={95} y={78} size={26} />
<text x="95" y="112" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Prices up to the</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giá tới lúc đóng</tspan></text>
<text x="95" y="130" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>close of day t</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cửa ngày t</tspan></text>
<line x1="174" y1="102" x2="184" y2="102" class="ln" /><polygon points="192,102 183,97 183,107" class="arrf" />
<rect x="196" y="52" width="150" height="100" rx="6" class="okb" />
<DiagramIcon name="model" x={271} y={78} size={26} />
<text x="271" y="112" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Signal computed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tín hiệu tính</tspan></text>
<text x="271" y="130" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>from that data</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>từ dữ liệu đó</tspan></text>
<line x1="350" y1="102" x2="360" y2="102" class="ln" /><polygon points="368,102 359,97 359,107" class="arrf" />
<rect x="372" y="52" width="150" height="100" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="clock" x={447} y={78} size={26} />
<text x="447" y="112" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Position held</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giữ vị thế</tspan></text>
<text x="447" y="130" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>through day t+1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>suốt ngày t+1</tspan></text>
<line x1="526" y1="102" x2="536" y2="102" class="ln" /><polygon points="544,102 535,97 535,107" class="arrf" />
<rect x="548" y="52" width="150" height="100" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="money" x={623} y={78} size={26} />
<text x="623" y="112" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Return of day t+1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lợi suất ngày t+1</tspan></text>
<text x="623" y="130" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>minus costs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trừ chi phí</tspan></text>
<line x1="702" y1="102" x2="712" y2="102" class="ln" /><polygon points="720,102 711,97 711,107" class="arrf" />
<rect x="724" y="52" width="150" height="100" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="chart" x={799} y={78} size={26} />
<text x="799" y="112" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Metrics over</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Số đo trên</tspan></text>
<text x="799" y="130" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>all the days</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mọi ngày</tspan></text>
<path d="M 20 166 L 20 174 L 346 174 L 346 166" class="goldl" />
<text x="183" y="194" class="goldt" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>knowable at the close of day t</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>biết được lúc đóng cửa ngày t</tspan></text>
<path d="M 372 166 L 372 174 L 698 174 L 698 166" class="ln" />
<text x="535" y="194" class="s" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>earned after the decision was made</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kiếm được sau khi đã quyết định</tspan></text>
<rect x="20" y="214" width="860" height="44" rx="6" class="box" />
<text x="450" y="241" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>A signal may use only what was known when the order would really have been placed.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tín hiệu chỉ được dùng thứ đã biết vào lúc lệnh thật sự được đặt.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The loop behind every backtest. The left half is what the strategy may know; the right half is what happens afterwards.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Vòng lặp nằm sau mọi backtest. Nửa trái là thứ chiến lược được phép biết; nửa phải là chuyện xảy ra sau đó.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp12-replay { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp12-replay-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp12-replay svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .atp12-replay text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .atp12-replay .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp12-replay .s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp12-replay .t13 { font-size: 13px; }
  .atp12-replay .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp12-replay .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp12-replay .goldt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp12-replay .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); }
  .atp12-replay .okb { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .atp12-replay .badb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .atp12-replay .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-replay .arrf { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp12-replay .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-replay .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-replay .redl { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-replay .goldl { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-replay .mutl { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-replay .redf { fill: var(--red); }
  .atp12-replay .goldf { fill: var(--gold); }
  .atp12-replay .mutf { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .atp12-replay .hole { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp12-replay figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
